# Accuenergy AcuVim II.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Accuenergy AcuVim II — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: accuenergy-acuvim-ii-modbus.pdf (41-page dedicated Modbus map)
# | - 3-phase advanced power quality meter with optional I/O modules (AcuVim IIR/IIE/IIW).
# | - FC03 (Read Holding Registers) for all registers listed here.
# | - All addresses are raw protocol addresses (0x4000 = 16384 decimal).
# | - Real-time: Float (IEEE 754, 2 registers, Big-Endian MSW first); power in kW/kvar/kVA.
# | - Energy: Dword (u32, 2 registers, Big-Endian); Primary Mode: real = Rx/10 → scale=0.1 kWh.
# | - THD: Word (u16, 1 register); real = Rx/100 → scale=0.01 %.
# | - Phase angles: Word (u16, 1 register); real = Rx/10 → scale=0.1 °; range 0–360°.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud=9600, 8N1.
